      "alt": "TQMLX2160A board",
      "text": "<h1>Based on LX2160A with enhanced data and networking performance</h1>\n<p>The TQMLX2160A Embedded Module, powered by the NXP Layerscape LX2160A processor, is tailored for embedded computing engineers. This Cortex-A72-based module excels in data and networking performance with features like 10G/100G Ethernet, 24x SerDes lanes for high-speed communication, DDR4 with ECC support, a 100Gb/s Data Compression Engine, and various connectivity interfaces. Engineers can choose from three CPU variants with 8, 12, or 16 Cortex-A72 cores to suit their requirements. This compact module ensures fast data communication with an array of interfaces and is equipped with robust memory options. Integrated security functions bolster data protection, making it ideal for demanding applications.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 11:07:23 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "altValueFromDAM": "false",
