     "table": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "text": "<table cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr><td><b>CPU</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li><p>CPU/Processor:</p>\n</li>\n<li>Cortex®-A72 - Up to 2,2GHz</li>\n<li><p>CPU variant:</p>\n</li>\n<li>LX2080A 8x A72</li>\n<li>LX2120A 12x A72</li>\n<li>LX2160A 16x A72</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Memory</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>eMMC: Up to 64 GB</li>\n<li>2x DDR4-SDRAM: Up to 64 GB</li>\n<li>Quad SPI NOR: Up to 512 MB</li>\n<li>EEPROM: 0/64-kbit</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Communications Interfaces</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>Ethernet:<ul>\n<li>Up to 2x Ethernet 10/100/1000 Mbit</li>\n<li>Up to 2x 40/50/100 G-Ethernet</li>\n<li>Up to 16x 1/2.5/10/25 G-Ethernet</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Serial Ports: Up to 2x UART</li>\n<li>USB: Up to 2x USB 3.0 OTG interface</li>\n<li>CAN: Up to 2x CAN FD</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Other Interfaces</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>SPI: Up to 3x SPI<ul>\n<li>Up to 1x QSPI (8-bit)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>GPIO: Up to 32x GPIO</li>\n<li>SATA: Up to 4x SATA 3.0</li>\n<li>SD Card: Up to 2x SDIO/eMMC</li>\n<li>I2C: Up to 6x I2C</li>\n<li>PCIe: Up to 6x PCIe Gen3 (up to 24 lanes)</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>General</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>Power supply: 5 V</li>\n<li>Dimensions: 126 mm x 78 mm</li>\n<li>Temperature sensor</li>\n<li>Voltage Monitoring</li>\n<li>Plug-in System: Board-to-board plug-in system 560 pins 0.5 mm Pitch</li>\n<li>Temperature range:<ul>\n<li>Standard temperature range: -25°C…+85°C</li>\n<li>Extended temperature: -40°C…+85°C</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>OS</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>Linux</li>\n<li>on request: VxWorks</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 11:07:44 GMT+0000",
